{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Saleblazers</strong></i> is an open world multiplayer shopkeeping survival game for 1-8 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight. Sell. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u00a0play as a shopkeeper living on an island filled with wild creatures and humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/a9f447033903cab2e377b3f83d258efa.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Shop, Your Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your shop from scratch and place items anywhere you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/c88ee22ff9d9826c3c84e2f173974128.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do whatever it takes to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/805c374d415fea728c89278788b916cd.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Businesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees and build defensive turrets. Sit back and relax as your shops run themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/24417592f74e930d416473db58efa305.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story campaign will test your shopkeeping and survival skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/e70b0d00129005554bec0876eed1fae5.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you prefer a calmer gameplay experience, try farming or fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/2620cf4927c3cc7f308da4b70e40f3d1.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Verified on Steam Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/b2e49e558c45f2b0093a47851e315e87.poster.avif?t=1753893303\" width=720 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/b2e49e558c45f2b0093a47851e315e87.webm?t=1753893303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/b2e49e558c45f2b0093a47851e315e87.mp4?t=1753893303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated server support (see Steam Community guide for details).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell anything on the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use anything as a weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and run multiple shops across the island. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees to run your store for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electricity system for powerful late-game items such as self-checkout machines or turrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamically reactive AI customers with unique needs and budgets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather, fish, farm, craft, buy, or loot to stock your shelves (beware of the police!). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main narrative campaign takes you on a treacherous journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted gameplay experience that works well in both singleplayer and multiplayer. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side quests, mini-bosses, and special orders make the open world come alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable PvP invasions and proximity voice chat for some unexpected fun! </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Benjamin Franklin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419850/a6b505607686934965b6b49cbf3a95941130b153.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419850/f7b51aa9b6d95c0c75dfed45193662a450d7c787.jpg"},{"name":"Stacking It Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419850/1c1e1223c3ce60bf45a96d97566112b09eb66b90.jpg"},{"name":"Brick by Brick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419850/43b4a766e6e8db0a5f02ffc546b1ed6393783974.jpg"},{"name":"Double Comma Club","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419850/f57b31029721ff2adefcab8b62e1b167673e5c36.jpg"},{"name":"No Lock is Safe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419850/b80328b4fedc827745ec927565e4f7b38bf0e05d.jpg"},{"name":"Early Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419850/80654dc616588476695663fe26224b31290d73b2.jpg"},{"name":"On the Same Side","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419850/80654dc616588476695663fe26224b31290d73b2.jpg"},{"name":"Just a Shopkeeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419850/80654dc616588476695663fe26224b31290d73b2.jpg"},{"name":"The North Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419850/80654dc616588476695663fe26224b31290d73b2.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1419850?t=1753893303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1419850?t=1753893303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/5f0c29d7ee7bc298e398059048d00642120c9769/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753893303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/5f0c29d7ee7bc298e398059048d00642120c9769/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753893303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Saleblazers</strong></i> is an open world multiplayer shopkeeping survival game for 1-8 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight. Sell. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u00a0play as a shopkeeper living on an island filled with wild creatures and humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/a9f447033903cab2e377b3f83d258efa.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Shop, Your Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your shop from scratch and place items anywhere you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/c88ee22ff9d9826c3c84e2f173974128.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do whatever it takes to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/805c374d415fea728c89278788b916cd.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Businesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees and build defensive turrets. Sit back and relax as your shops run themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/24417592f74e930d416473db58efa305.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story campaign will test your shopkeeping and survival skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/e70b0d00129005554bec0876eed1fae5.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you prefer a calmer gameplay experience, try farming or fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/2620cf4927c3cc7f308da4b70e40f3d1.avif?t=1753893303\" width=596 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Verified on Steam Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/b2e49e558c45f2b0093a47851e315e87.poster.avif?t=1753893303\" width=720 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/b2e49e558c45f2b0093a47851e315e87.webm?t=1753893303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/b2e49e558c45f2b0093a47851e315e87.mp4?t=1753893303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated server support (see Steam Community guide for details).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell anything on the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use anything as a weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and run multiple shops across the island. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees to run your store for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electricity system for powerful late-game items such as self-checkout machines or turrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamically reactive AI customers with unique needs and budgets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather, fish, farm, craft, buy, or loot to stock your shelves (beware of the police!). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main narrative campaign takes you on a treacherous journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted gameplay experience that works well in both singleplayer and multiplayer. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side quests, mini-bosses, and special orders make the open world come alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable PvP invasions and proximity voice chat for some unexpected fun! </p></li></ul>","developers":["AIRSTRAFE INTERACTIVE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/header.jpg?t=1753893303","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Chip<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 Chip<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Chip<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 Chip</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1419850/736047/1bf0911d639ab7e487cb8303cfdf3b304c390a3e/1750686550/dash_av1.mpd?t=1724186285","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1419850/736047/1bf0911d639ab7e487cb8303cfdf3b304c390a3e/1750686550/dash_h264.mpd?t=1724186285","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1419850/736047/1bf0911d639ab7e487cb8303cfdf3b3